        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a church at the end of your street- but there shouldn't be. You saw it when walking home from the bus stop after work. You grew up on this street. You have walked down this road daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is not a church at the end of the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based horror game, you play as someone haunted by a church. It infects your day, and will do anything to get you to come inside. Will you be able to resist it? Or will the church swallow you whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Drawn Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Church </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative -  Your choices change how you interact with the church</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings - Some good, some bad, some ????</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a church at the end of your street- but there shouldn't be. You saw it when walking home from the bus stop after work. You grew up on this street. You have walked down this road daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is not a church at the end of the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based horror game, you play as someone haunted by a church. It infects your day, and will do anything to get you to come inside. Will you be able to resist it? Or will the church swallow you whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Drawn Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Church </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative -  Your choices change how you interact with the church</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings - Some good, some bad, some ????</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The church is impatient. The church is hungry. The church is willing to do anything to get you back.",
